---
import { site, asset } from "../data/site";
---
<section class="intro" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="intro-text" data-reveal>
    <p>I am a senior Android engineer in {site.location.split(",")[0]}. I take apps from first architecture to Play Store release, and I make inherited codebases shippable.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="intro-body" data-reveal style="--d:80ms">
    <p>My work spans real-time messaging, live-class video, logistics hardware and attendance security. I work remotely, and I mentor the developers beside me.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="intro-side" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
    <img src={asset("img/intro.jpg")} alt="Weathered concrete apartment block with small windows" width="900" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <p class="note">Based in {site.location}, working with teams across time zones.</p>
  </div>
</section>
